OL,3,GNEWSAScottish prisons 'at the brink'
OL,4,Aafter worst riot in a decade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA riot at a young offenders institution
OL,7,Flast month was the worst disorder in
OL,8,Fone of Scotland's jails in a decade,
OL,9,Fthe prison service has said.
OL,11,FPrison officers from four other jails
OL,12,Fwere called in to restore control
OL,13,Fduring the incident at HMP & YOI
OL,14,FPolmont in September, which involved
OL,15,Fabout 30 inmates.
OL,17,FLinda Pollock, chief executive of the
OL,18,FScottish Prison Service (SPS), said it
OL,19,Fwas an example of "bubbling tension"
OL,20,Fcaused by increasing overcrowding
OL,21,Fwithin the estate.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
