OL,3,GNEWSAScottish prisons 'at the brink'
OL,4,Aafter worst riot in a decade
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after the Scottish government
OL,7,Freleased projections estimating the
OL,8,Fprison population could rise to 9,450
OL,9,Fnext year ` 1,650 over the current
OL,10,Fdesign capacity.
